# English only (casamiento-backend)

This repository is **English-only**. Apply to every change in this project.

## Required

- **File and folder names** in English (`invitations/`, not `invitaciones/`)
- **Code identifiers**: classes, functions, variables, types, enums
- **API routes and JSON fields** in English (`/api/invitations`, `name`, `status`)
- **Comments, logs, Swagger text, and error messages** in English
- **Env var names** in English (`DEMO_DASHBOARD_NAME`, not `NOMBRE`)
- **Database tables and columns** in English (`invitations`, `allows_plus_one`)

## Allowed exceptions

- **Guest-facing copy** returned only if explicitly required by a product spec (prefer English in this API)
- **Proper nouns** in seed/demo data (e.g. guest names in examples)
- **External bucket names** or third-party URLs already provisioned (`casamiento-vanesa-augusto-album`)

## Do not

- Add Spanish (or mixed) module names, routes, or DTO fields
- Reintroduce legacy Spanish paths (`/api/invitaciones`, `/api/album-fotos`, etc.)

## RSVP status values

Use: `pending` | `yes` | `no` | `unsure` (not `si`, `no`, `aun_no_lo_se`).
